  {"if": "you open the bed many times a day", "then": "A retractable that locks at any position saves time on every stop. Accept the canister's 10–11 in of lost bed space."},
  {"if": "you plan a bed rack or rooftop tent", "then": "Buy a railed retractable such as the RetraxPRO XR, or a rack listed as compatible with your specific cover, before you buy either one."},
